+### Description
+I have a test like this:
+```
+from pytest import fixture
+
+
+def t(foo):
+    return foo
+
+
+@fixture
+def foo():
+    return 1
+
+
+def test_right_statement(foo):
+    assert foo == (3 + 2) * (6 + 9)
+
+    @t
+    def inner():
+        return 2
+
+    assert 2 == inner
+
+
+@t
+def outer():
+    return 2
+```
+The test "test_right_statement" fails at the first assertion,but print extra code (the "t" decorator) in error details, like this:
+
+```
